- Documentation qualification passed nine commands, English and Chinese books,37 HTML outputs per language and3040 active translations with zero lost translations or generated drift.
- Strict affected all-target Rust lint, formatting, shared-home and layer checks passed within their recorded scopes.
- Fresh native and host generation85330 exited0 on source72fa: original production dependency checksum cohorts, actual PyO3 inputs, all32 exact untimed records and source/artifact readbacks passed. Independent complete twelve-row analytical cost audit PASS (original row15 MET), accepted by root: no remaining native/host body, caller/callee, SSA work, frame, ABI, capture/drop or worker/numeric finding. Native ThinLTO/host no-LTO proof profiles are distinguished from production fat-LTO; no timing claim is made. Earlier failed projection emissions and diagnostics remain retained history.

